---
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang={siteConfig.language}>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>页面不存在 · {siteConfig.title}</title>
    <style>
      body { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 0; padding: 32px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); }
      main { width: min(100%, 560px); padding: 40px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: var(--paper-3); box-shadow: 10px 12px 0 rgba(87, 69, 42, .08); }
      .eyebrow { color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; }
      h1 { margin: 14px 0 12px; font-family: var(--expressive); font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 56px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15; }
      p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
      nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 26px; }
      a { padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }
      a:hover { border-color: var(--sage); color: var(--sage); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <span class="eyebrow">404 · LOST IN TOWN</span>
      <h1>这条街还没有房子</h1>
      <p>你访问的页面不存在，可能是旧链接已经搬家。回到小镇或文章档案继续探索吧。</p>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">返回小镇</a>
        <a href="/posts/">文章档案</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
